Complete pixel-level design specification — Green Valley Farm Field 03 dashboard
This is a detailed frontend reconstruction specification for the exact screenshot you uploaded. It describes the layout, dimensions, positioning, alignment, component hierarchy, typography, spacing, colors, borders, imagery, chart geometry, and individual UI elements.

The goal is to make it possible for a developer to recreate the interface from scratch using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, SVG and image assets, without having to guess how the page is arranged.
