19. Important visual effects
There are several subtle effects that give the screenshot its distinctive appearance.
19.1 Glass-like card surfaces
The cards are not completely opaque.

The background foliage is slightly visible through the darker green surfaces.

Use a combination of translucent backgrounds, gradients and subtle inset shadows.
.glass-panel {
    background:
        linear-gradient(
            145deg,
            rgba(8, 64, 42, .88),
            rgba(1, 35, 23, .94)
        );

    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);

    border: 1px solid rgba(105, 190, 137, .38);

    box-shadow:
        inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.055),
        0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.18);
}


